YQ\u002FI6\u002FKW97HSDNV6JG.png"},{"@context":"https:\u002F\u002Fschema.org","@type":"ListItem","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fibm-cloud-pak-for-applications\u002Freviews","name":"IBM Cloud Pak for Applications","position":24,"additionalType":"http:\u002F\u002Fschema.org\u002FProduct","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fibm-cloud-pak-for-applications\u002Freviews"},{"@context":"https:\u002F\u002Fschema.org","@type":"ListItem","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fhuawei-cloud-servicestage\u002Freviews","name":"Huawei Cloud ServiceStage","position":25,"additionalType":"http:\u002F\u002Fschema.org\u002FProduct","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fhuawei-cloud-servicestage\u002Freviews"}]},{"@context":"https:\u002F\u002Fschema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What does application infrastructure software do?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EApplication infrastructure software supports application features, functions, and services. It offers a framework for application development and provides the necessary resources for successful application delivery. Monitoring and performance management capabilities help ensure satisfactory application performance.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the benefits of using application infrastructure software?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EApplication infrastructure software promotes secure, consistent, high-performance, high-quality application delivery, enhances productivity, provides the foundation for increased revenue opportunities, and improves end-user and customer satisfaction. Their application development frameworks facilitate new product development and expedite time to market. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does application infrastructure software cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EVendor quotes are required for software pricing; however, many application infrastructure tools are open source and free of charge. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E"}}]}]}
