,"attribute":"html","value":"Make Confident Tech Decisions with Trusted Reviews"}]}],"hashVersion":2,"hashAttribute":"id","urlPatterns":[{"include":true,"type":"simple","pattern":"https:\u002F\u002Ftrustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Ftrustradius-buyers\u002Freviews\u002F*"}],"weights":[0.5,0.5],"filters":[],"seed":"3267dbab-5811-40c5-b5a1-c85f98fc578a","phase":"0","coverage":1,"meta":[{"key":"0"},{"key":"1"}]}],"attributes":{"isAuthenticated":false,"visitorId":"anonymous","anonymous_id":"anonymous","bot":true,"testAutomation":false,"cohorts":["category group 2\u002F2","category group 2\u002F3","category-filters-enabled"],"slug":"application-infrastructure","pageType":"category"}},"nonce":{"variations":{}},"categoryPage":{"category":{"_id":"559466a1d171582c000f1d23","name":"Application Infrastructure","suffix":"Software","slug":"application-infrastructure","acronym":"","meta":{"article":{"description":"","title":""},"detail":{"description":"","title":""},"product":{"description":"","title":""},"review":{"description":"","title":""}},"relatedCategories":[{"_id":"55945ce75d3c9f180018e17a","slug":"api-management","name":"API Management","acronym":"","suffix":"Tools","faq":[{"question":"What do API management tools do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EDevelopers use API management tools to create, control, and monitor their APIs. These products aim to help organizations streamline and standardize the API lifecycle.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-01-26T19:44:27.645Z","_id":"61f1a49bb177db002339cab0"},{"question":"What are the benefits of using API management tools?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EOrganizations that use API management tools commonly see improved consistency, reliability, and ROI from their APIs. Developers using these products often increase their productivity and find it easier to troubleshoot issues with their API.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-01-26T19:44:46.969Z","_id":"61f1a4ae0716be0039955e44"},{"question":"What are the best API management tools?","answer":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EPopular API management tools include:\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fpostman\"\u003EPostman\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fswaggerhub\"\u003ESwaggerHub\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fazure-api-management\"\u003EAzure API Management\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Famazon-api-gateway\"\u003EAmazon API Gateway\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fmulesoft-anypoint-platform\"\u003EAnypoint Platform\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fapigee-edge\"\u003EApigee\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002F3scale-api-management-platform\"\u003E3scale API Management Platform\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fibm-api-management\"\u003EIBM API Management\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E","created":"2022-01-26T19:45:02.501Z","_id":"61f1a4be0716be0039955e79"},{"question":"How much do API management tools cost?","answer":"Pricing for API management tools can range from $15 to $150 per user per month. Some vendors price by consumption or by usage hour instead. Vendors commonly offer free trials and free tiers for individuals and small teams.","created":"2022-01-26T19:45:20.974Z","_id":"61f1a4d00716be0039955ec4"}]},{"_id":"5061d96ae1ff5d02000001ae","name":"Application Server","slug":"application-server","suffix":"Software","acronym":"","faq":[]},{"_id":"57eec92cfae48800156679e3","slug":"database-load-balancing","name":"Database Load Balancing","acronym":"","suffix":"","faq":[{"_id":"6047ee204622be001cc6a5e3","question":"What businesses benefit most from database load balancing software?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EThe more databases a business has access to, the more important a load balancing tool is.  A load balancing tool will ensure that your business isn’t leaning too hard on any particular server.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-04-02T20:51:30.090Z"},{"_id":"6047ee2f2005890045cd00c0","question":"Do I need replication, log shipping, and database mirroring features?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EMost businesses won’t need all 3 of the database load balancing methods.  Usually, just one or two will do.  That said, for businesses with stringent load balancing needs, a solution offering replication, log shipping, and database mirroring may be appropriate.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-04-02T20:51:30.090Z"},{"_id":"6047ee46c44e120046b510a1","question":"Are there any free or open-source database load balancing tools?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EThere are no fully-featured free database load balancing tools, but most tools do offer a time-based free trial.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-04-02T20:51:30.091Z"}]},{"_id":"5061d96ae1ff5d02000001ad","name":"Electronic Data Interchange (EDI)","slug":"electronic-data-interchange-edi","suffix":"","acronym":"","faq":[]},{"_id":"55a5430f3663311800468a40","slug":"enterprise-service-bus","name":"Enterprise Service Bus","acronym":"ESB","suffix":"Software","topRatedSectionDescription":"","faq":[{"_id":"61242795a7e0e6003aff8f14","question":"What does Enterprise Service Bus Software do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EEnterprise service bus (ESB) software acts as middleware between different applications for communication and data transferring. They are used to aid businesses in agility and to develop a more secure, enterprise-class solution as well as add new capabilities to existing enterprise applications.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-23T22:56:21.087Z"},{"_id":"612427a11dbb640042bba6c1","question":"What are the benefits of using Enterprise Service Bus Software?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EThe benefits to using ESB software tools include increasing productivity by enhancing the facilitation of messages between services and control departments as well as being able to monitor these exchanges. These tools allow users to respond quickly to new business opportunities by developing a secure and effective enterprise solution.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-23T22:56:33.149Z"},{"_id":"612427bb1dbb640042bba6f7","question":"What are the best Enterprise Service Bus Software products?","answer":"\u003Cp\u003EThe top enterprise service buses include:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fibm-app-connect\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EIBM App Connect\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fazure-service-bus\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EMicrosoft Azure Service Bus\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Ftibco-cloud-integration\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003ETIBCO Cloud Integration\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fwso2-enterprise-service-bus\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EWSO2 Enterprise Service Bus\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Feric-madariaga\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EArcESB\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fworkday-business-process-framework\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EWorkday Business Process Framework\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fservicemix.apache.org\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EApache ServiceMix\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fmule-esb\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EMule ESB\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Foracle-service-bus\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EOracle Service Bus\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fwebsphere-enterprise-service-bus\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EWebSphere Enterprise Service Bus\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E","created":"2021-08-23T22:56:59.443Z"},{"_id":"612427c6dbebe4001d914e81","question":"How much does Enterprise Service Bus Software cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EPricing for enterprise service bus software varies between vendors and usually may change depending on the add-on options you decide on. Basic packages begin at the $400 to $600 range per month. For additional add-ons, premium packages can go well above $1000 per month. Most of the vendors do not display their pricing publicly and may be contacted to obtain current and customized pricing.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-23T22:57:10.707Z"}]},{"_id":"55943d873633a62c0026a09b","slug":"integration-platform-as-a-service","name":"Integration Platform as a Service (iPaaS)","acronym":"","suffix":"Software","topRatedSectionDescription":"","faq":[{"_id":"5fb2e1ee5e9260003726efea","question":"What businesses benefit most from iPaaS?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EBusinesses with many data sources or pipelines that need to be integrated benefit most from iPaaS solutions.  Usually, this means larger businesses tend to need them more than small businesses, but small businesses with many integration needs will still appreciate iPaaS solutions. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2020-12-28T15:01:29.253Z"},{"_id":"5fb2e1f91165f40031139c2e","question":"What are the best iPaaS options?","answer":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EThe top rated IPaaS options are as follows:\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fzapier\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EZapier\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Foracle-integration\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003EOracle Integration\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fsap-cloud-platform\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003ESAP Cloud Platform\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Ftibco-cloud-integration\u002Freviews\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003ETibco Cloud Integration (Including Businessworks and Scribe)\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E","created":"2020-12-28T15:01:29.253Z"},{"_id":"5fb2e208961bbb0031179665","question":"How do freemium iPaaS options work?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EMost freemium iPaaS options offer a few free integrations, which can be enough for very small businesses.  These options also typically include a pay as you go model, which can make them very approachable for growing businesses. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2020-12-28T15:01:29.253Z"}]},{"_id":"55a543431efd332c00226200","slug":"message-oriented-middleware","name":"Message Oriented Middleware","acronym":"MOM","suffix":"","faq":[{"_id":"6172cbed93e5b00042db16e8","question":"What is Message Oriented Middleware?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EMOM is the go-between for software applications and hardware across an IT infrastructure. MOM facilitates communication across an IT infrastructure. The middleware creates a communications layer that insulates developers from the complexity of different operating systems and network protocols.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-10-22T14:34:21.329Z"},{"_id":"6172cc018348d800396f68b6","question":"Who benefits most from Message Oriented Middleware?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EMOM is beneficial to larger enterprises with disparate IT infrastructure. By facilitating communication across a large infrastructure, MOM can ensure a system stays in sync. The investment in MOM may not be worth it for smaller organizations with smaller IT infrastructures.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-10-22T14:34:41.767Z"},{"_id":"6172cc1a9ed0a000439112f5","question":"How much does Message Oriented Middleware cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EThere are several open-source options for MOM. Paid solutions are often custom enterprise-level solutions that are dependent upon the size of your infrastructure and organizational needs.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-10-22T14:35:06.591Z"}]},{"_id":"55a5435f77ebf42200330264","slug":"message-queue","name":"Message Queue","acronym":"Message Queuing","suffix":"Software","faq":[]},{"_id":"55bd39171c5cdf1d004cffbc","slug":"net-development","name":".Net Development","acronym":"","suffix":"Services","faq":[{"_id":"610c538d557a0f0023c4b69a","question":"What does .Net Development Services do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003E.Net Development Services support application development, testing, and tech support for .Net. Microsoft’s open-source, cross-platform, multi-language development platform is used by large and small companies as a reliable, secure, and scalable way to achieve their IT goals. .Net is used to create and deploy a variety of applications including cloud apps, web services, mobile apps, IoT apps, and eCommerce apps. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-05T21:09:33.524Z"},{"_id":"610c539b61f224001c933df1","question":"What are the benefits of using .Net Development Services?","answer":"\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003ELarge Ecosystem\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003E – Can tap into global .Net development resources \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003ETech Support\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003E - Wide availability of high-quality tech support from .Net application development service companies\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003EInteroperability\u002FAdaptability\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003E – With its open-source and cross-platform capabilities, developers can work with any type of application running on any platform, in any location and environment\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003EProductivity\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003E – Cross-platform and multiple-language support enables developers to select the best possible tools for their development goals\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003EPerformance\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003E – Fast response times that require less processing power\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003ESecurity\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003E – Managed run time environment, prevents altered compiler code or pointer manipulation\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003ECost Savings\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003E – Large reusable object-oriented code libraries save time and money\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E","created":"2021-08-05T21:09:47.023Z"},{"_id":"610c53a9557a0f0023c4b6db","question":"How much does .Net Development Services cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003E.Net development services costs vary greater depending upon the vendor services provided, complexity, and scale of the project. It can range from a couple of thousand dollars to well over six figures.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-05T21:10:01.623Z"}]},{"_id":"5134e0a39bc4460200000091","acronym":"PaaS","name":"Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS)","slug":"platform-as-a-service-paas","suffix":"Solutions","topRatedSectionDescription":"","faq":[{"_id":"5ea06368aef5d9001e2ce9d7","question":"What is Platform as a Service software?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EPlatform as a service is a cloud computing service that provides a computing stack as a service for developing applications. Platform as a Service software provides components such as operating systems, and databases so developers can focus on developing and worry less about issues like scalability.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2020-12-28T14:54:08.088Z"},{"_id":"5ea0641a3df45600233b4bb1","question":"What is the best Platform as a Service software?","answer":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EThe Top Rated Platform as a Service software include:\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Faws-lambda\u002Freviews\"\u003EAWS Lambda\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fmicrosoft-azure\u002Freviews\"\u003EMicrosoft Azure\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fsalesforce-lightning-platform\u002Freviews\"\u003ESalesforce Lightning Platform\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","created":"2020-12-28T14:54:08.088Z"},{"_id":"5ea06430d5d8b0003808b476","question":"What are the benefits of Platform as a Service Software?","answer":"The biggest advantage of Platform as a Service software that it allows for quicker application development, so products can be developed and released sooner. Additionally, since platform as a service software includes development tools that allow developers to write less code while developing.","created":"2020-12-28T14:54:08.088Z"},{"_id":"5ea0644520c18b003e0fec5f","question":"How much does Platform as a Service cost?","answer":"For developing on a budget, there are free Platform as a Service options including Dokku, an open-source software, and proprietary options with free versions for smaller projects. For larger projects that want a proprietary software, pricing is dependent on number of users and the amount of data used. Services can start as low as $0.01 per gigabyte, but as more features and users are needed, prices increase.","created":"2020-12-28T14:54:08.088Z"}]},{"_id":"55a543b5b5c1eb0e000c9c99","slug":"soa-application-gateways","name":"SOA Application Gateways","acronym":"","suffix":"","faq":[{"_id":"6123af03c062840024c09fba","question":"What do SOA application gateways do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003ESOA application gateways consolidate enterprise applications where they can be securely accessed under centrally enforceable policies by users within or outside the enterprise.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003E They enhance security efforts, technical services, and help enforce business policies. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-23T14:21:55.891Z"},{"_id":"6123af0e7e59540040ac817b","question":"What are the benefits of using SOA application gateways?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EUsers investing in SOA application gateways will see an improvement in security within their system as well as easier communication and data transfer between applications. These gateways also provide the user with visibility of all systems being integrated which helps keep track and monitor productivity. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-23T14:22:06.623Z"},{"_id":"6123af18212c600038c16a94","question":"How much do SOA gateway products cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EMany of the vendors for SOA application gateways do not display their pricing options publicly and should be contacted for customized quotes. Expect payments to be billed on a monthly basis. Some products, such as \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ca style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.trustradius.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fakana-api-gateway-on-the-akana-platform\u002Freviews\"\u003EAkana SOLA\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003E, offer a 30-day free trial. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-08-23T14:22:16.718Z"}]},{"_id":"55a543a0c83fa822004d6422","slug":"soa-governance","name":"SOA Governance","acronym":"","suffix":"Software","faq":[{"_id":"61032cd6d5e730002adb4197","question":"What businesses benefit most from SOA Governance","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003EIT governance is essential for any business with a robust IT infrastructure.  That said, SOA governance tools are more specialized.  They are most important for businesses who need to manage processes in service oriented architecture.  Other businesses can use more generalist tools. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-07-29T22:33:58.528Z"},{"_id":"61032e1355c103003e239b8e","question":"Are there free or open source SOA Governance tools?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003EThere are some open source SOA governance tools that are feature complete for businesses looking for a free option.  That said, these tools are only appropriate for businesses with a skilled enough team to implement them.  The man hours in implementation and maintenance should be considered.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-07-29T22:39:15.533Z"},{"_id":"61032e1e7a13400023f80797","question":"What are the key features of SOA Governance tools?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003ESOA governance tools provide process management, dependency management, and policy management features.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2021-07-29T22:39:26.855Z"}]},{"_id":"55bd4d0ffacb26130014e894","slug":"software-components","name":"Software Components","acronym":"","suffix":"","faq":[]},{"_id":"628bc36951c92900338deefc","name":"Server Management","suffix":"Software","faq":[{"_id":"628bc382bb3baa004724116f","question":"What does server management software do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EServer management software oversees physical and virtual server installations that can reside on a variety of platforms. Its resource monitoring and troubleshooting capabilities contribute to successful application, website, and network performance. Maintenance features ensure the environment is up to date with the latest patches and security updates.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-05-23T17:25:22.947Z"},{"_id":"628bc38e202a940028ca07c9","question":"What are the benefits of using server management software?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EServer management software automation reduces manual workloads, promotes efficiency, and streamlines server management. It lowers costs, increases stability, reduces downtime, and contributes to a secure server environment. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-05-23T17:25:34.416Z"},{"_id":"628bc3a0282333002ef57e61","question":"How much does server management software cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EPricing begins around $21 a month for a single node and ranges into thousands of dollars when managing large numbers of servers. Free open-source tools are available, as are free trials.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-05-23T17:25:52.005Z"}],"slug":"server-management"},{"_id":"62a3aa23312c610043f1e54e","name":"JavaScript Frameworks","faq":[{"_id":"62a3aa70a12896003b9ec63e","question":"What do JavaScript frameworks do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EJavaScript frameworks provide pre-written code for JavaScript development. They include helpful pre-written functions, enforce application structure, and support reusable templates.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-06-10T20:32:48.423Z"},{"_id":"62a3aa9c263dc5003f37efc9","question":"What are the benefits of using JavaScript frameworks?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EJavaScript frameworks help developers create websites and applications faster and more consistently. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-06-10T20:33:32.198Z"},{"_id":"62a3aaa4263dc5003f37f00e","question":"How much do JavaScript frameworks cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EJavaScript frameworks are usually free on their own. Integrations with other products or additional features may require purchase.  \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-06-10T20:33:40.161Z"}],"slug":"javascript-frameworks"},{"_id":"63374366c32f66001f2cf9df","name":"Java Technologies","faq":[{"_id":"633b0bf096332f01a25ddaef","question":"What do Java technologies do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EJava technologies provide the tools to develop, execute, monitor, manage, and optimize Java applications that support complex web applications and web services, mission-critical and scientific applications, mobile, and IoT devices. They are used by companies to build and host their Java IT infrastructure and applications.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-10-03T16:21:04.032Z"},{"_id":"633b0c1296332f01a25ddbfe","question":"What are the benefits of using Java technologies?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EJava technologies facilitate Java application development, improve application performance, reduce response times, and increase user satisfaction. They lessen implementation dependencies and support platform independence, interoperability, and scalability. They contribute to more efficient use of CPU and memory, lowering infrastructure costs.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-10-03T16:21:38.416Z"},{"_id":"633b0cc196332f01a25de1bf","question":"How much do Java technologies cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EPricing for Java technologies can vary widely depending on  the type of software and use case. Enterprise installations can cost from under $10,000 to over $400,000 per year. Discounts are provided for large deployments. Free open-source products are available.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2022-10-03T16:24:33.990Z"}],"slug":"java-technologies"},{"_id":"65a076d790a3768cdded3a9d","name":"Interoperability","slug":"interoperability","suffix":"Platforms","faq":[{"_id":"65a0777211e8627554be00ff","question":"What do Interoperability Platforms do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EInteroperability platforms facilitate seamless communication and integration between different systems, applications, or organizations, enabling improved information sharing, collaboration, and streamlined processes.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2024-01-11T23:19:14.331Z"},{"_id":"65a07795788ba94d793ee7bb","question":"What are the benefits of using interoperability platforms?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EThe major benefits of using Interoperability Platforms include time and cost savings, increased productivity, enhanced collaboration, improved data accuracy, and the ability to meet compliance and regulatory requirements.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2024-01-11T23:19:49.749Z"},{"_id":"65a077cb0b42333d2c05c701","question":"How much do interoperability platforms cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EPricing for interoperability platforms is typically not publicly disclosed and is based on factors such as vendor, deployment model, and feature set. Vendors often provide custom quotes tailored to the specific needs of the organization. Some vendors may offer free trials or limited free versions of the software for evaluation purposes.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E","created":"2024-01-11T23:20:43.970Z"},{"_id":"65a18dae788ba97a6f4587d4","question":"What are the best interoperability platform products?","answer":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003EThe most popular Interoperability Platforms products are as follows:\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 247);\"\u003E{{TOP_RATED_LIST}}\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","created":"2024-01-12T19:06:22.964Z"}]}],"trustmap":{"addCategories":[],"addProducts":[],"date":null,"facetNames":["CompanySize"],"includeSecondary":false,"minFacetedRatings":10,"minFacetedRatingsPercent":20,"minRatings":10,"period":30,"published":false,"removeProducts":["55954cada8935b2c007b4bc9"]},"suppressSEOIndex":false,"html":"\u003Ch2\u003EWhat is Application Infrastructure Software?\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApplication infrastructure software supports the development, delivery, and monitoring of business applications. Sometimes referred to as AIM (Application Infrastructure and Middleware) Software, it encompasses the software that is required to support all the features, functions, and services offered by an application.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApplication features and their resource requirements will determine which application infrastructure software tools are appropriate. Application infrastructure software’s wide-ranging functions support multi-layered application architectures, including presentation layers, logic layers, and data layers, delivering individual application services, application microservices, and monolithic applications.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApplication infrastructure software is deployed on-premises or in the cloud and helps ensure the dependable, secure, and high-performance delivery of applications.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis software includes application integration, transformation, and modernization features that promote productive and efficient use of applications and their resources.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EApplication Infrastructure Software Features\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApplication Infrastructure Software will offer many of the following features.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EApplication development and delivery framework\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EContainer management\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EApplication integration, modernization, APIs\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EApplication monitoring\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESupport and monitor application servers, web servers, database servers, and networks\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ELoad balancing\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EStorage management\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESecurity, firewalls, and intrusion detection\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPerformance management\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAnalytics, ML, AI, data visualization, dashboards, and reporting\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EApplication Infrastructure Software Comparison\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EConsider the following before purchasing Application Infrastructure Software.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUse Case\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Selection of application infrastructure software tools will be based on the type of applications you are running, their resource requirements, and your IT infrastructure. For example, Amazon EC2 supports cloud-based application services, Red Hat Open Shift supports Kubernetes application platforms, others like .Net support building a broad range of applications and services.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECost:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E There are several open-source free software tools that can be explored before making a financial investment in other tools For example, .Net is a free open-source development platform that creates apps and services on multiple devices and operating systems and Apache offers free open-source, cross-platform web server software.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPreparation:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E To help with your selection of new application infrastructure software, undertake an inventory of your current applications, those that are under development and those scheduled for development. Identify their application resource and service requirements, and their interdependencies. This information will guide your decision-making.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EPricing Information\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMany application infrastructure software tools are open source and free of charge. The no-cost tools sometimes have a cap on the scale of the deployment. Vendor quotes are required for other tools and are based on the software’s features and the scale and characteristics of your IT infrastructure. Free trials are available.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n","description":"Application infrastructure software and tools provides and ensures integrations between an enterprise's applications to support business workflow.","formattedDescription":{"html":"Application infrastructure software and tools provides and ensures integrations between an enterprise's applications to support business workflow.","text":"Application infrastructure software and tools provides and ensures integrations between an enterprise's applications to support business workflow."},"faq":[{"question":"What does application infrastructure software do?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EApplication infrastructure software supports application features, functions, and services. It offers a framework for application development and provides the necessary resources for successful application delivery. Monitoring and performance management capabilities help ensure satisfactory application performance.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E"},{"question":"What are the benefits of using application infrastructure software?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EApplication infrastructure software promotes secure, consistent, high-performance, high-quality application delivery, enhances productivity, provides the foundation for increased revenue opportunities, and improves end-user and customer satisfaction. Their application development frameworks facilitate new product development and expedite time to market. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E"},{"question":"How much does application infrastructure software cost?","answer":"\u003Cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003EVendor quotes are required for software pricing; however, many application infrastructure tools are open source and free of charge. \u003C\u002Fspan\u003E"}],"ad":{"enabled":false,"dismissText":"","link":"","linkText":"","title":""},"splitTest":"2b","videos":[],"fullName":"Application Infrastructure Software","productsForIndexationFeed":[]},"bestProducts":[{"_id":"55954eff1d0ee01d00f30174","name":".NET","slug":"net"},{"_id":"5ef4e2fb6fba35002d1503d0","name":"AWS Auto Scaling","slug":"aws-auto-scaling"},{"_id":"559544944c8e430e000572df","name":"Apache HTTP Server","slug":"apache-http-server"},{"_id":"5ef4db8cd65d8f00234ddd62","name":"Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","slug":"amazon-ec2-auto-scaling"},{"_id":"55955646bf7f3f31007811a7","name":"TIBCO ActiveSpaces","slug":"tibco-activespaces"},{"_id":"559467a7afb0170e00d8ffb6","name":"InterSystems Ensemble","slug":"intersystems-ensemble"},{"_id":"559548df837ebb2c00274af5","name":"SAP Business Rules Management","slug":"sap-business-rules-management"},{"_id":"55954f50837ebb2c00274bcd","name":"Microsoft AppFabric (discontinued)","slug":"microsoft-appfabric"},{"_id":"653fc9e2acd69bf258eff968","name":"F5 Distributed Cloud App Connect","slug":"f5-distributed-cloud-app-connect"},{"_id":"645e8540321e7c793b6ccd5a","name":"Django","slug":"django"}]},"topRated":{"awardInfo":{"products":[],"awardBadgeUrls":{},"year":0}},"categoryPageProducts":{"featureGroups":[],"searchCriteria":{"from":0,"size":25,"maxTypeSize":3},"searchData":{"hits":[{"doc":{"_id":"55955603bf7f3f31007811a4","slug":"nginx","vendor":{"_id":"55a15fe3ab5dd83100e85e8d","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FoO\u002Fbi\u002FC802NVLZVC9G.png","squareOriginal":"","square180":""}},"logo":"https:\u002F\u002Fdudodiprj2sv7.cloudfront.net\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FGx\u002Frk\u002FHZH9E0BT304J.png","pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.nginx.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fpricing","html":"\u003Cdiv\u003ENGINX, a business unit of F5 Networks, powers over 65% of the world's busiest websites and web applications. NGINX started out as an open source web server and reverse proxy, built to be faster and more efficient than Apache. Over the years, NGINX has built a suite of infrastructure software products o tackle some of the biggest challenges in managing high-transaction applications. \u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003ENGINX offers a suite of products to form the core of what organizations need to create applications with performance, reliability, security, and scale. This includes NGINX Plus for load balancing, reverse proxy, and application delivery controller features, NGINX App Protect for high performance web application firewall security, and NGINX Unit to run the application code, all monitored and managed by the NGINX Controller.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENGINX Plus: An all‑in‑one load balancer, web server, and content cache.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENGINX Controller: Centralized monitoring and management for NGINX Plus. \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENGINX App Protect: Web application firewall, powered by F5\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENGINX Unit: Lightweight application server, with support for multiple languages and a dynamic REST API‑driven configuration\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENGINX Ingress Controller: Traffic management solution for cloud‑native apps in Kubernetes and containerized environments. \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENGINX Service Mesh: Lightweight, Turnkey, Developer-Friendly Service Mesh Using NGINX Plus as an Enterprise Sidecar\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E","name":"NGINX","description":"","trialAvailable":true,"editionPricing":[],"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FGx\u002Frk\u002FHZH9E0BT304J.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002F3s\u002FRN\u002F97DT9BKJ2M34.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FI0\u002FEv\u002F97DT9BKJ2M34-180x180.PNG"},"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":92},"reviewsRating":{"count":48},"featureRatings":[{"name":"IDE support","count":10,"trScore":7.103},{"name":"Security management","count":18,"trScore":7.861},{"name":"Administration and management","count":18,"trScore":7.288},{"name":"Application server performance","count":18,"trScore":8.164},{"name":"Installation","count":18,"trScore":9.741},{"name":"Open-source standards compliance","count":16,"trScore":7.266}],"count":140,"avg":9.1},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"awards":[{"_id":"6411ed8159d9a25c775977d2","awardType":"toprated","awardState":"awarded","expirationDate":"2025-05-11T06:00:00.000Z"}],"previousSlugs":["nginx-web-application-firewall-waf"],"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Load balancing","Static content","Memory usage"],"cons":["Community support","Error codes","User friendly"]},"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"649add7dd4e178ef9a7c555c"},{"_id":"649add7dd4e1781a3a7c5565"},{"_id":"649add7dd4e1787ac17c556a"},{"_id":"649add7dd4e17884f67c5570"},{"_id":"649add7dd4e178f55d7c5577"},{"_id":"649df707278c2d3f1a5f2c48"}]},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"5f7e21db7a75250043d2aa60","links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"","text":""},"pricing":{"url":"","text":""}},"vendor":{"_id":"55a15fe3ab5dd83100e85e8d","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FoO\u002Fbi\u002FC802NVLZVC9G.png","squareOriginal":"","square180":""}},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.f5.com\u002Fcloud\u002Fcompare","html":"\u003Cp\u003EF5 Distributed Cloud WAF leverages F5's Advanced WAF technology, delivering WAF-as-a-Service and combining signature- and behavior-based protection for web applications.  It acts as an intermediate proxy to inspect application requests and responses to block and mitigate a broad spectrum of risks stemming from the OW ASP Top 10, persistent and coordinated threat campaigns, bots, and layer 7 DoS. \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003EF5 Distributed Cloud WAF requires no hardware or software to implement or maintain, set up, deploy, manage and scale.  It provides hybrid deployment options to secure applications wherever they are deployed, including entirely as  SaaS via F5's network points-of-presence (PoPs) or locally across public clouds, customer data centers and at the customer edge.  This is accomplished leveraging F5's global network and centralized console for critical app security policy enforcement whenever it's required.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EBenefits\u003C\u002Fb\u003E\u003Cp\u003EF5 Distributed Cloud WAF is designed to ease the burden and complexity of\nconsistently securing distributed web apps by delivering:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cb\u003ESimplified operations:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E SaaS-delivered WAF that’s set up, deployed, managed and scale across clouds, on-premises data centers, and edge sites.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cb\u003EDevOps agility + SecOps control: \u003C\u002Fb\u003EDelivers the programmability that DevOps needs combined with the\nefficacy and oversight that SecOps mandates, enabling faster application delivery and release cycles.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cb\u003EReduced time to resolution:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Improves visibility and insight across WAF and DDoS security events, and into app\nperformance, including intuitive drill-down capabilities.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cb\u003EComprehensive protection with fewer false positives:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Utilizes both signature-based and AI\u002FML based\ndetection techniques with automatic signature tuning to ensure maximum efficacy and reduced SecOps\nworkloads. \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","name":"F5 Distributed Cloud WAF (Web Application Firewall)","description":"F5 Distributed Cloud WAF leverages F5's Advanced WAF technology, delivering WAF-as-a-Service and combining signature- and behavior-based protection for web applications. It acts as an intermediate proxy to inspect application requests and responses to block and mitigate a broad spectrum of risks stemming from the OW ASP Top 10, persistent and coordinated threat campaigns, bots, and layer 7 DoS.","trialAvailable":true,"logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FFD\u002Fur\u002FXT2X1GPMNNB7.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fit\u002F3A\u002FXT2X1GPMNNB7-180x180.PNG"},"editionPricing":[],"awards":[{"_id":"6411ed8159d9a25c775977d2","awardType":"toprated","awardState":"awarded","expirationDate":"2025-05-11T06:00:00.000Z"}],"slug":"f5-distributed-cloud-waf","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":65},"reviewsRating":{"count":71},"featureRatings":[],"count":136,"avg":9},"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":true,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Vpn access","Remote work"],"cons":["Internet connectivity"]},"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"6629b05a4799bcd4fd7cd043"}]},"previousSlugs":["volterra","threat-stack-cloud-security-platform"],"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}},"licensedFeatureSlugs":["custom-greeter-text","ratings-only-event-mode","custom-questions","vendor-commenting","report-reviews-ratings","report-product-scorecard","report-feature-scorecard","report-rating-explorer","profile-ctas-backlinks","report-reference-candidates","report-followup-request","manage-tags","tag-reviews","trustquotes-library-and-csv-export","api-trustquotes","api-trustquotes-for-web","trustquotes-for-web-unlimited","influitive-advocates","api-product-scores","value-email","buyer-leads"]}},{"doc":{"_id":"6227826a6b880700224b1c7c","links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.sap.com\u002Fproducts\u002Ftechnology-platform\u002Ftrial.html","text":"Try SAP BTP for free"},"pricing":{"url":"","text":"Try SAP BTP for free"}},"awards":[{"_id":"6411ed8159d9a25c775977d2","awardType":"toprated","awardState":"awarded","expirationDate":"2025-05-11T06:00:00.000Z"}],"name":"SAP Business Technology Platform","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf020000010c","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fbo\u002FS8\u002FV427IV05FX1W.jpeg","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fc6\u002FpG\u002FPTMNPLTF2444.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002F8q\u002FXp\u002FPTMNPLTF2444-180x180.JPEG","square50":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FX2\u002FS9\u002FZP5ROJ75EQDD.png"}},"description":"SAP Business Technology Platform (SAP BTP) is the company's Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS) offering, that brings together intelligent enterprise applications with database and data management, analytics, integration and extension capabilities into one platform for both cloud and hybrid environments, including hundreds of pre-built integrations for SAP and third-party applications.","startingPrice":{"price":0},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fstore.sap.com\u002Fdcp\u002Fen\u002Fproduct\u002Fdisplay-9999951781_live_v1\u002Fsap-business-technology-platform","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fbo\u002FS8\u002FELVBX8NAFP5F.jpeg","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fc6\u002FpG\u002FECPDGK0G2K2E.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002F8q\u002FXp\u002FECPDGK0G2K2E-180x180.JPEG"},"editionPricing":[],"trialAvailable":true,"slug":"sap-business-technology-platform","html":"\u003Cp\u003ESAP Business Technology\nPlatform (SAP BTP) is the company's cloud platform, that\nbrings together intelligent enterprise applications with database and data\nmanagement, analytics, integration and extension capabilities into one platform\nfor both cloud and hybrid environments, including hundreds of prebuilt business\ncontent and integrations for faster time-to-value. It can be used to create personalized\nexperiences across business processes, build applications, analytics, and\nintegrations faster, and to run mission-critical innovation confidently on major\ncloud providers' infrastructure fully managed by SAP.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESAP BTP offers a range\nof capabilities and services that:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\n \u003Cli\u003Eoffers fit-for-purpose tools and services that are optimized for\n     SAP applications along with composable bespoke business processes\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n \u003Cli\u003Eprovides an open environment with pre-built connectors to 3rd party\n     apps and the availability to run on leading hyperscaler IaaS Clouds (AWS,\n     Azure, GCP, etc) \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n \u003Cli\u003Econnects AI &amp; ML into business processes to enhance intelligence,\n     automation, and productivity\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n \u003Cli\u003Edelivers security and improved insights by keeping data\n     close to core business processes and applications\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n \u003Cli\u003Eenables future-proofing by keeping core systems clean, greatly\n     reducing technical debt to take advantage of cloud economics\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":575},"reviewsRating":{"count":488},"featureRatings":[{"name":"Ease of building user interfaces","count":458,"trScore":7.825},{"name":"Scalability","count":458,"trScore":7.895},{"name":"Platform management overhead","count":438,"trScore":7.143},{"name":"Workflow engine capability","count":392,"trScore":7.295},{"name":"Platform access control","count":442,"trScore":7.406},{"name":"Services-enabled integration","count":431,"trScore":7.793},{"name":"Development environment creation","count":428,"trScore":7.646},{"name":"Development environment replication","count":371,"trScore":7.303},{"name":"Issue monitoring and notification","count":418,"trScore":6.861},{"name":"Issue recovery","count":364,"trScore":6.931},{"name":"Upgrades and platform fixes","count":401,"trScore":7.422}],"count":1063,"avg":8.4},"isSubscribed":true,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Asset management","Workforce management","Knowledge management"],"cons":["Sap business","Free tier","Using excel"]},"productDemos":{"files":[]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}},"licensedFeatureSlugs":["custom-greeter-text","ratings-only-event-mode","custom-questions","vendor-commenting","report-reviews-ratings","report-product-scorecard","report-feature-scorecard","report-rating-explorer","profile-ctas-backlinks","report-reference-candidates","report-followup-request","manage-tags","tag-reviews","trustquotes-library-and-csv-export","api-trustquotes","api-trustquotes-for-web","trustquotes-for-web-unlimited","influitive-advocates","api-product-scores","value-email","buyer-leads","api-vi-product-level","report-visitor-insights"]}},{"doc":{"_id":"653fc9e2acd69bf258eff968","prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"","text":""},"pricing":{"url":"","text":""}},"awards":[],"isSubscribed":true,"name":"F5 Distributed Cloud App Connect","vendor":{"_id":"55a15fe3ab5dd83100e85e8d","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FoO\u002Fbi\u002FC802NVLZVC9G.png","squareOriginal":"","square180":""}},"description":"Securely connects distributed apps and services across public cloud, on-premises, and edge environments. Utilizing Infrastructure as Code, App Connect provisions resources and maintain uniform policies across multiple sites.","startingPrice":{"price":null},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.f5.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fget-f5\u002Fcompare","logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"html":"Distributed Cloud App Connect is a SaaS-based service that provides app-to-app connectivity and orchestration for workloads distributed across multiple cloud regions, providers, and edge sites. Distributed Cloud App Connect ensures secure application-layer networking between clouds with granular service and request-level controls for DevOps.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EDistributed Cloud App Connect supports a range of capabilities to securely connect apps and services across multiple cloud and edge sites.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApp networking - Load balancing for TCP, UDP, and HTTP\u002FS requests\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApp segmentation - Granular policies to secure endpoint access\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEnd-to-end encryption - Native TLS encryption from workload-to-workload\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApp security integration - Same Distributed Cloud Console for app and API security\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EService discovery - Cross-cluster service discovery\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObservability - App-level dashboards and metrics\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngress and egress - Route-based policy enforcement for HTTP and HTTPS traffic\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","editionPricing":[],"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"66c77726dfdf73450c7d83d4"}]},"trialAvailable":true,"security":{"whisticLink":""},"slug":"f5-distributed-cloud-app-connect","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":0},"reviewsRating":{"count":4},"featureRatings":[],"count":4,"avg":8},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}},"licensedFeatureSlugs":["custom-greeter-text","ratings-only-event-mode","custom-questions","vendor-commenting","report-reviews-ratings","report-product-scorecard","report-feature-scorecard","report-rating-explorer","profile-ctas-backlinks","report-reference-candidates","report-followup-request","manage-tags","tag-reviews","trustquotes-library-and-csv-export","api-trustquotes","api-trustquotes-for-web","trustquotes-for-web-unlimited","influitive-advocates","api-product-scores","value-email","buyer-leads"]}},{"doc":{"_id":"559733ddf240bc18005029a8","slug":"oracle-cloud-infrastructure","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf02000000f8","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fwq\u002FEd\u002FPLWD0I98LPAB.png","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FH5\u002FYC\u002FL3EGT3KWZ2GO-180x180.PNG","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FgR\u002FNC\u002FL3EGT3KWZ2GO.PNG"}},"logo":"","pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.oracle.com\u002Fcloud\u002Fpricing\u002F?source=:ad:oct:trs:dg:a_nas::RC_WWMK230914P00038:&SC=:ad:oct:trs:dg:a_nas::RC_WWMK230914P00038:","html":"\u003Cp\u003ESolutions from\ncontainers to VMware to AI, offered through a common set of 100+ services in\neach OCI region, across clouds, or in a data center with consistent pricing worldwide. OCI can be used to migrate, modernize, build, and scale all workloads, including existing and new applications and data platforms.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EUsers can develop intelligent applications with a choice of open-source\ntools, such as Java,  the programming language for cloud native development,\nand MySQL, the world’s most popular open-source database. Oracle boasts a strong commitment to the open-source community and directly support Hadoop,\nKubernetes, Linux, and Python.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EOCI spans 46 interconnected commercial and\ngovernment cloud regions across the globe. For increased support of customer\ncloud strategies, Oracle Cloud also offers a full suite of Oracle Cloud\nApplications and direct interconnection with Microsoft Azure.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","name":"Oracle Cloud Infrastructure","description":"Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) is Oracles's infrastructure-as-a-service (IaaS) platform which combines the utility of public cloud with the granular control, security, and predictability of on-premises infrastructure.","trialAvailable":true,"links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fgo.oracle.com\u002FLP=132427?src1=:ad:oct:trs:dg:a_nas::RC_WWMK230914P00038:&SC=:ad:oct:trs:dg:a_nas::RC_WWMK230914P00038:","text":"Free Product Tour"},"pricing":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.oracle.com\u002Fcloud\u002Feconomics","text":"OCI Pricing"}},"editionPricing":[],"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":229},"reviewsRating":{"count":131},"featureRatings":[{"name":"Service-level Agreement (SLA) uptime","count":127,"trScore":8.337},{"name":"Dynamic scaling","count":127,"trScore":7.965},{"name":"Elastic load balancing","count":118,"trScore":8.363},{"name":"Pre-configured templates","count":116,"trScore":6.487},{"name":"Monitoring tools","count":126,"trScore":7.725},{"name":"Pre-defined machine images","count":114,"trScore":6.803},{"name":"Operating system support","count":125,"trScore":6.45},{"name":"Security controls","count":127,"trScore":7.019},{"name":"Automation","count":91,"trScore":7.196}],"count":360,"avg":8.6},"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FRS\u002FW6\u002FFVQ0IRDO39OL.png","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FOp\u002Fru\u002F85R9XC20QFE1-180x180.PNG","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FOp\u002Fru\u002F85R9XC20QFE1.PNG"},"awards":[{"_id":"6411ed8159d9a25c775977d2","awardType":"toprated","awardState":"awarded","expirationDate":"2025-05-11T06:00:00.000Z"}],"previousSlugs":["oracle-cloud-infrastructure-as-a-service-iaas","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-oci","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-audit","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-data-transfer-appliance","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-database","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-fastconnect-classic","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-ravello-service","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-registry-ocir","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-container-engine-for-kubernetes-oke","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-identity-and-access-management","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-load-balancing","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-networking","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-storage","oracle-cloud-infrastructure-compute"],"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Oracle cloud","Easy to use","Oracle database"],"cons":["User interface","Third party","Load balancing"]},"productDemos":{"files":[]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"6058f468c625eb0037197d55","links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fcloud.ibm.com\u002Fcodeengine\u002Foverview?utm_medium=Peerreview&utm_source=TrustRadius&utm_content=CCEWW&utm_term=30AST&utm_id=Code-Engine-Trial-on-TR","text":"Try it for free"},"pricing":{"url":"","text":""}},"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FZl\u002FrW\u002FMF8T3JXWXT0M.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FRy\u002FyP\u002FNN0Q2EN7SCF8.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FBn\u002FjB\u002FNN0Q2EN7SCF8-180x180.JPEG"},"vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf02000000cd","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002FT691TK96I5L1.png","squareOriginal":"","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002FT691TK96I5L1.png"}},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fcloud.ibm.com\u002Fcodeengine\u002Foverview?utm_medium=Peerreview&utm_source=TrustRadius&utm_content=CCEWW&utm_term=30ADM&utm_id=Code-Engine-Trial-on-TR","name":"IBM Cloud Code Engine","trialAvailable":true,"editionPricing":[],"slug":"ibm-cloud-code-engine","html":"IBM Cloud Code Engine is a \u003Cb\u003Efully managed, serverless platform\u003C\u002Fb\u003E that unifies the deployment of \u003Cb\u003Econtainers and applications including web apps, microservices, event-driven functions, or batch jobs\u003C\u002Fb\u003E. This serverless compute service aims to \u003Cb\u003Eremove the burden of building, deploying, and managing workloads in Kubernetes \u003C\u002Fb\u003Eso users can \u003Cb\u003Efocus on writing code\u003C\u002Fb\u003E and not on the infrastructure that is needed to host it.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EWith IBM Cloud Code Engine users can run any workload serverlessly. That includes long-running containers and batch jobs as well as bursty and short-lived functions. The platform dynamically scales containers according to load, has monitoring, logging and a service mesh “built in.” The vendor states users \u003Cb\u003Edon't need to choose between long execution times, high resource limits, private networking and scale-to-zero but instead have it all\u003C\u002Fb\u003E on one fully-managed platform, without needing infrastructure skills.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fibm.biz\u002FCloud_Code_Engine_product_page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Ehttps:\u002F\u002Fibm.biz\u002FCloud_Code_Engine_product_page\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E \u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","awards":[],"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":13},"reviewsRating":{"count":15},"featureRatings":[{"name":"Scalability","count":15,"trScore":7.217},{"name":"Services-enabled integration","count":15,"trScore":6.624}],"count":28,"avg":8.6},"isSubscribed":true,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Easy to use","Execution time","Highly scalable"],"cons":["Per project","Ibm cloud","User interface"]},"productDemos":{"files":[]},"startingPrice":{"price":null},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"description":"","meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}},"licensedFeatureSlugs":["custom-greeter-text","ratings-only-event-mode","custom-questions","vendor-commenting","report-reviews-ratings","report-product-scorecard","report-feature-scorecard","report-rating-explorer","profile-ctas-backlinks","report-reference-candidates","report-followup-request","manage-tags","tag-reviews","trustquotes-library-and-csv-export","api-trustquotes","api-trustquotes-for-web","trustquotes-for-web-unlimited","influitive-advocates","api-product-scores","value-email","buyer-leads"]}},{"doc":{"_id":"55b02c08d7819f2c0052d4fe","slug":"tibco-cloud-integration","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf0200000072","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FIf\u002FHS\u002F99SJ2ATUDD8I.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002F1B\u002F5e\u002FRMNIMTW93FUN.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fkf\u002FkH\u002FRMNIMTW93FUN-180x180.PNG","square50":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FYc\u002F69\u002F0DV0KRAK2C1A.png"}},"logo":"https:\u002F\u002Fdudodiprj2sv7.cloudfront.net\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FRo\u002F8z\u002F39L4DGCG5QJ1.png","pricingUrl":"","html":"\u003Cdiv class=\"row\"\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETIBCO Integration is used to connect diverse business solutions, data sources, and devices into a single, seamless system. TIBCO accelerates connectivity initiatives with low and no-code experiences engineered to reduce development time and costs. Users can implement the best-fit style of integration to address any app, data, IoT, B2B and mobile\u002Fweb integration use case. TIBCO Integration can connect to virtually any endpoint across the IT ecosystem with 200+ pre-built connectors for a wide variety of business suites, databases and legacy technologies.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","name":"TIBCO Integration (including BusinessWorks and Flogo)","description":"TIBCO Integration is used to connect diverse business solutions, data sources, and devices into a single, seamless system.","trialAvailable":false,"links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tibco.com\u002Fplatform\u002Fintegration","text":"Learn More"},"pricing":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tibco.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fcloud-integration\u002Fpricing-plans","text":""}},"editionPricing":[],"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FRo\u002F8z\u002F39L4DGCG5QJ1.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FJi\u002FQU\u002F592HM8F7THI8.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fyy\u002FBa\u002F592HM8F7THI8-180x180.JPEG"},"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":266},"reviewsRating":{"count":236},"featureRatings":[{"name":"Pre-built connectors","count":121,"trScore":7.239},{"name":"Connector modification","count":8,"trScore":5.455},{"name":"Support for real-time and batch integration","count":117,"trScore":6.793},{"name":"Data quality services","count":6,"trScore":5.455},{"name":"Data security features","count":7,"trScore":2.727},{"name":"Monitoring console","count":121,"trScore":7.345}],"count":502,"avg":8.6},"previousSlugs":["tibco-activematrix-businessworks","tibco-businessworks","iway-enterprise-information-management-suite"],"awards":[{"_id":"6411ed8159d9a25c775977d2","awardType":"toprated","awardState":"awarded","expirationDate":"2025-05-11T06:00:00.000Z"}],"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Easy to use","User friendly","Drag and drop"],"cons":["Error messages","Version 5","Various apps"]},"productDemos":{"files":[]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"5061d969e1ff5d0200000085","name":"IBM WebSphere Hybrid Edition","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":84},"reviewsRating":{"count":33},"featureRatings":[{"name":"IDE support","count":26,"trScore":7.096},{"name":"Security management","count":31,"trScore":8.448},{"name":"Administration and management","count":31,"trScore":7.71},{"name":"Application server performance","count":31,"trScore":8.211},{"name":"Installation","count":30,"trScore":7.8},{"name":"Open-source standards compliance","count":26,"trScore":7.324}],"count":117,"avg":7.8},"slug":"ibm-websphere-hybrid-edition","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf02000000cd","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002FT691TK96I5L1.png","squareOriginal":"","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002FT691TK96I5L1.png"}},"description":"WebSphere Hybrid Edition from IBM is a collection of WebSphere application runtimes and modernization tools that provides support for on-premise and major public cloud deployments, in virtual machines, containers and Kubernetes. The user can choose any WebSphere edition and deploy Liberty and application modernization tools to help move to a cloud-native architecture, modernize existing applications and support an existing WebSphere estate.","editionPricing":[{"_id":"601329faac990f0038c089fd"}],"logo":"","pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ibm.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fwebsphere-hybrid-edition\u002Fpricing?utm_medium=Peerreview&utm_source=TrustRadius&utm_content=WHEWW&utm_term=30A9B&utm_id=WHE-pricing-page-on-TR","trialAvailable":false,"awards":[],"logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ibm.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fwebsphere-hybrid-edition?utm_medium=Peerreview&utm_source=TrustRadius&utm_content=WHEWW&utm_term=30A9B&utm_id=WHE-product-page-on-TR"},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"startingPrice":{"price":null},"previousSlugs":["ibm-websphere","ibm-websphere-application-server-on-cloud","ibm-websphere-application-server"],"isSubscribed":false,"html":"WebSphere Hybrid Edition is a comprehensive \ncollection of WebSphere application runtimes and modernization tools \nthat provides support for on-premise and major public cloud deployments,\n in virtual machines, containers and Kubernetes. Any WebSphere \nedition can deploy Liberty and application modernization tools to help \nthe user move to a cloud-native architecture, modernize existing \napplications and supporting an existing WebSphere estate.","productDemos":{"files":[]},"prosAndCons":{"cons":[],"pros":[]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"5c999ea12b6c23002053dcae","links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"vendor"