sers to automatically add or remove EC2 instances according to definable conditions.","trialAvailable":false,"logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"editionPricing":[],"awards":[],"slug":"amazon-ec2-auto-scaling","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":37},"reviewsRating":{"count":15},"featureRatings":[],"count":52,"avg":8.8},"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["High traffic","High availability","Based on rules"],"cons":["Bit confusing","Ec2 instance","User friendly"]},"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"649ade2cd4e178c4287d5171"}]},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"5f77493c395c450037b207c1","links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fabp.io\u002Fdemo","text":"Free Live Demo"},"pricing":{"url":"","text":""}},"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002F7B\u002FEW\u002F7FW98Q4TDLG0.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FZx\u002FUw\u002FNCRGGP87UQ95.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fms\u002FGL\u002FNCRGGP87UQ95-180x180.PNG"},"vendor":{"_id":"5f761c2976910500308bc426","logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FB3\u002FiK\u002FO0BQCOMZX0GW.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fht\u002F48\u002FO0BQCOMZX0GW-180x180.JPEG"}},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fabp.io\u002Fpricing","name":"ABP","trialAvailable":true,"editionPricing":[{"_id":"5f76f196bfeb8d0046141da9"},{"_id":"5f76f1acd380f2002a62f6be"},{"_id":"5f76f1bb870053002a304e30"}],"slug":"abp","html":"\u003Cp\u003EA web development platform for modern ASP.NET Core applications based on the open-source, strong, and mature ABP Framework. Volosoft states the service provides:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eenterprise-ready, feature-rich, pre-built application modules (e.g. Identity Server management, SaaS management, language management, etc.)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003Erapid application development tooling to support your development productivity (e.g. ABP Suite)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eprofessional UI themes\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPremium support\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003ETime is the most precious resource which shouldn't be wasted fussing with redeveloping most used functionalities. ABP aims to save developers &amp; enterprises a lot of time by providing common application requirements. It is a base solution and a rapid start for production-ready web applications. It is fully customizable with the source code included. There’s a global open-source community behind dedicated to making it better.","awards":[],"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":2},"reviewsRating":{"count":3},"featureRatings":[],"count":5,"avg":8.1},"description":"","startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Look and feel","End users","Common features"],"cons":["Greater flexibility","Immediate response","Ci cd"]},"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"649ade30d4e1783e717d5e4b"}]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"previousSlugs":["abp-commercial"],"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"554cdbd8d493691300507f96","slug":"mirantis-kubernetes-engine","vendor":{"_id":"5596ddb2df22062c00ee62be","logos":{"squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FK1\u002Flm\u002F0NV6N21GPAUA.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FBh\u002FQK\u002F0NV6N21GPAUA-180x180.PNG"}},"logo":"https:\u002F\u002Fdudodiprj2sv7.cloudfront.net\u002Fproduct-logos\u002F1j\u002Feo\u002FR1O1JHFQBJET.png","pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fstore.mirantis.com","name":"Mirantis Kubernetes Engine","description":"The Mirantis Kubernetes Engine (formerly Docker Enterprise, acquired by Mirantis in November 2019)aims to let users ship code faster. Mirantis Kubernetes Engine gives users one set of APIs and tools to deploy, manage, and observe secure-by-default, certified, batteries-included Kubernetes clusters on any infrastructure: public cloud, private cloud, or bare metal.","trialAvailable":true,"editionPricing":[{"_id":"62671270c3cde200488f35a0"},{"_id":"6267127a7fd4140032d6c5ca"}],"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":172},"reviewsRating":{"count":37},"featureRatings":[],"count":209,"avg":9.4},"logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"awards":[],"links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"previousSlugs":["swarm","mirantis-cloud-platform","mirantis-cloud-native-suite"],"startingPrice":{"price":500},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Set up","Virtual machine","Allowing multiple"],"cons":["Docker containers","Learning curve","User friendly"]},"productDemos":{"files":[]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"624acad13ce0a7004899eade","links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"awards":[],"name":"Gatsby","slug":"gatsby","vendor":{"_id":"624ac87135b04000401a682d","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002F7V\u002FVv\u002FB7CER7C0MM1Q.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Flk\u002FRP\u002F7K1FC8JS7N3G.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fhq\u002Fyi\u002F7K1FC8JS7N3G-180x180.PNG"}},"description":"GatsbyJS was born in May 2015 as a simple way to build a website or an app with React. Gatsby has been used to build apps and websites from blogs and portfolio pages to company homepages and e-commerce applications.","startingPrice":{"price":50},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.gatsbyjs.com\u002Fpricing","logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"html":"Gatsby is a full-stack frontend framework designed to present everything needed to create a web site or web application. It aims to help developers build websites that are fast, flexible, and secure right out of the box using React. The user can also deploy the site on Gatsby Cloud to provide a better development experience.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EGatsby automates code splitting, image optimization, inlining critical styles, lazy-loading, prefetching resources, and performs other tasks to ensure the user's site is fully optimized, without manual tuning. Gatsby’s serverless rendering generates static HTML at build time. So there is no server and no reachable database equals no malicious requests, DDOS attacks, or accidental exposure. A Gatsby site’s attack surface is nonexistent.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EAnd the vendor states that hosting Gatsby website on Gatsby Cloud, the company's hosting service, gives access to a secure, scalable, and performant Edge Network, specifically built to run the best Gatsby experiences. Gatsby Cloud has a global edge network that can deliver optimized content to visitors around the world, using SSL, encryption at multiple layers, and a CDN powered by Fastly.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EGatsby Cloud uses intelligent optimization on a globally distributed real-time edge network to reduce the time spent waiting for updates to actually get deployed to end user. Combined with Rollback capabilities for each atomic deployment users may act with the confidence neeeded to deploy hundreds of times a day.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EAdditionally, the Gatsby Concierge service includes a partnership with a team of Gatsby experts to optimize, support, and ultimately to help build the best Gatsby experience. Whether the service is used to help with build times, website performance and slow loading times, or for a more confident onboarding process augmented with the help of a professional team, there is a Gatsby Concierge program that aims to help the user get the most out of Gatsby.","editionPricing":[{"_id":"624acbd51e1d7a0038c60687"},{"_id":"624acbefbf849e002bed3bb6"}],"trialAvailable":true,"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":1},"reviewsRating":{"count":0},"featureRatings":[],"count":1,"avg":10},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"559467a7afb0170e00d8ffb6","slug":"intersystems-ensemble","vendor":{"_id":"559467697dd8b6310068792c","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FzN\u002F9F\u002F5ST7ZAKA3TLF.png","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Ful\u002F3x\u002FAGS7SS4QTI7I-180x180.PNG","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FmC\u002Fr1\u002FAGS7SS4QTI7I.PNG"}},"logo":"https:\u002F\u002Fdudodiprj2sv7.cloudfront.net\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FQF\u002Frg\u002FWIHRDEK2CLHD.png","pricingUrl":"","html":"\u003Cdiv\u003EInterSystems Ensemble is a data platform to build integrated  solutions, manage orchestration and utilizing messaging queues.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Ch4\u003EBuilt-in Data and Message Repository\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAccording to the vendor, Ensemble offers high-performance data processing, guaranteed message delivery, resumption of interrupted business processes, analytics of both real-time and historical data, and reliability due to its database mirroring technology.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Ch4\u003EAdapter Library and Framework\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEnsemble adapters provide out-of-the-box connectivity and data transformations for packaged applications, databases, industry standards, protocols, and technologies – including SQL, HL7, SOAP, HTTP, FTP, SAP, TCP, LDAP, Pipe, Telnet, and Email. Object inheritance and SOAP services minimize the effort required to build any needed custom adapters. Using Ensemble’s unit testing service, custom adapters can be be tested without first having to complete the entire project.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E","name":"InterSystems Ensemble","description":"Ensemble from global company InterSystems (headquartered in Massachusetts) is a middleware and application infrastructure offering.","trialAvailable":false,"editionPricing":[],"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002F4ROAJ0FQKTK6.png","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002F4ROAJ0FQKTK6.png"},"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":6},"reviewsRating":{"count":2},"featureRatings":[],"count":8,"avg":9.5},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"awards":[],"previousSlugs":["ensemble"],"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Easy to use","Multiple data sources","Quick and efficient"],"cons":["Hard disk","Bells and whistles","Transactional data"]},"productDemos":{"files":[]},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"5f76427cd380f2002a62b777","links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"Learn More","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.appvia.io\u002Fproduct\u002F"},"pricing":{"text":"Pricing Info","url":""}},"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fr8\u002Fdo\u002F0A9TVAV3LZ1B.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fd8\u002F0i\u002F98I4HLOLS605.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FBm\u002FmU\u002F98I4HLOLS605-180x180.PNG"},"vendor":{"_id":"5f789d0e5a8df60023930325","logos":{"squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002F0T\u002FaP\u002FTUSLHOIMD9GF.PNG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FiH\u002F8l\u002FTUSLHOIMD9GF-180x180.PNG","default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FqN\u002FDc\u002FWKHUQ2DFOS0F.png"}},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.appvia.io\u002Fpricing\u002F","name":"Appvia Wayfinder","trialAvailable":false,"editionPricing":[],"slug":"appvia","html":"\u003Cdiv\u003EAppvia Wayfinder is a solution for managing cloud infrastructure, a self-service platform  that supports developers, streamline workflows, and maintain top-tier security.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EKey Features and Benefits:\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E1. \u003Cb\u003ESelf-Service Capabilities\u003C\u002Fb\u003E: Wayfinder's self-service system permits developers to provision and manage cloud resources without the typical complexities, to reduce technical hurdles and enable teams to focus more on innovation and less on operations.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E2. \u003Cb\u003EStrong Security Posture:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Incorporating the principles of process isolation and a 'least privilege' approach, Wayfinder ensures security. Users are granted minimum access necessary for their tasks, reducing potential vulnerabilities and enhancing overall system safety.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E3. \u003Cb\u003ECentralised Control:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Wayfinder provides a centralised control platform, allowing for the maintenance of organisational standards without hindering the agility of the development team. This balance of flexibility and control is a standout feature of Wayfinder.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E4. \u003Cb\u003EComprehensive Visibility:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E With Wayfinder, users enjoy a consolidated view of all their clusters, applications, and cloud resources across multiple cloud platforms. This streamlined visibility reduces the need for constant tab-switching or tool juggling, making resource management more efficient.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E5. \u003Cb\u003EDedicated Support:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Appvia offers customer service through a dedicated support team that available to assist users with any queries, with the goal of ensuring a seamless experience with Wayfinder.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EDifferentiators:\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EWayfinder aims to combine ease of use with a powerful feature set, to support the needs of medium to large enterprises. The balance it strikes between self-service capabilities for developers and centralised control for platform teams is presented as its unique selling point, as well as the company's commitment to robust security via process isolation and the 'least privilege' approach.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EReturn on Investment:\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EBy simplifying the complexities of cloud infrastructure management, Wayfinder helps teams to operate more efficiently. And Its security measures can prevent costly data breaches, providing an additional ROI.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EAppvia Wayfinder boasts users among engineering teams worldwide.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","awards":[],"description":"","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":0},"reviewsRating":{"count":0},"featureRatings":[],"count":0,"avg":0},"startingPrice":{"price":0.035},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"649ade9ed4e17845f87e210b"}]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"645e83ec9d27d13abe3b9517","prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"awards":[],"isSubscribed":false,"name":"Fastify","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf0200000050","logos":{"default":"","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FBV\u002FRP\u002FTH8LRKM7CPWW-180x180.JPEG","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fg4\u002FHl\u002FTH8LRKM7CPWW.JPEG"}},"description":"Fastify is a web framework, for Node.js, available free and open source under an MIT license.","startingPrice":{"price":0},"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Ffastify\u002Ffastify","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FF8\u002FI7\u002FG9ITZTMFKLAR.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FiD\u002Fz9\u002F5EP1R0J1DSF9.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002F0X\u002FfI\u002F5EP1R0J1DSF9-180x180.JPEG"},"html":"Fastify is a web framework, for Node.js, available free and open source under an MIT license.","editionPricing":[],"productDemos":{"files":[]},"trialAvailable":false,"security":{"whisticLink":""},"slug":"fastify","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":0},"reviewsRating":{"count":0},"featureRatings":[],"count":0,"avg":0},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"5ef4e2fb6fba35002d1503d0","links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf020000008f","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FKl\u002FW0\u002FEM9FFHJ74VNC.png","square50":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FIv\u002FOw\u002FAT9Q9JWWPG3O.jpeg","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fg3\u002FnH\u002F1TDXH4LPI5BH.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FLY\u002FYM\u002F1TDXH4LPI5BH-180x180.JPEG"}},"pricingUrl":"","name":"AWS Auto Scaling","description":"AWS Auto Scaling monitors applications and automatically adjusts capacity to maintain steady, predictable performance at the lowest possible cost. The vendor states that using AWS Auto Scaling, it’s easy to setup application scaling for multiple resources across multiple services in minutes.","trialAvailable":false,"logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"editionPricing":[],"awards":[],"slug":"aws-auto-scaling","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":105},"reviewsRating":{"count":5},"featureRatings":[],"count":110,"avg":8.6},"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Cost management","Fault tolerance","No downtime"],"cons":["Difficult to understand","Better use","Spin up"]},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"5061d969e1ff5d020000003b","name":"Oracle WebLogic Server","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":73},"reviewsRating":{"count":43},"featureRatings":[{"name":"IDE support","count":32,"trScore":6.045},{"name":"Security management","count":34,"trScore":8.472},{"name":"Administration and management","count":36,"trScore":7.149},{"name":"Application server performance","count":35,"trScore":8.299},{"name":"Installation","count":36,"trScore":8.137},{"name":"Open-source standards compliance","count":24,"trScore":9.289}],"count":116,"avg":6.7},"slug":"oracle-weblogic-server","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf02000000f8","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fwq\u002FEd\u002FPLWD0I98LPAB.png","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FH5\u002FYC\u002FL3EGT3KWZ2GO-180x180.PNG","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FgR\u002FNC\u002FL3EGT3KWZ2GO.PNG"}},"description":"Oracle WebLogic Server is a unified and extensible platform for developing, deploying and running enterprise applications, such as Java, for on-premises and in the cloud. WebLogic Server offers a scalable implementation of Java Enterprise Edition (EE) and Jakarta EE.","editionPricing":[],"html":"Oracle WebLogic Server is a unified and extensible platform for developing, deploying and running enterprise applications, such as Java, for on-premises and in the cloud. WebLogic Server offers a scalable implementation of Java Enterprise Edition (EE) and Jakarta EE.","logo":"","pricingUrl":"","trialAvailable":false,"awards":[],"logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"Learn More","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.oracle.com\u002Fmiddleware\u002Fweblogic"},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":["Application server","Data sources","Easy to deploy"],"cons":["User friendly","Learning curve","Admin console"]},"previousSlugs":["oracle-weblogic-bea","oracle-weblogic-suite"],"productDemos":{"files":[]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"624ad7063ce0a700489a36b8","links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"awards":[],"name":"Gridsome","slug":"gridsome","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf0200000050","logos":{"default":"","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FBV\u002FRP\u002FTH8LRKM7CPWW-180x180.JPEG","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fg4\u002FHl\u002FTH8LRKM7CPWW.JPEG"}},"description":"Gridsome is a Vue.js framework that helps to make serverless websites & apps easier, and is open source and free under the MIT license.","startingPrice":{"price":null},"pricingUrl":"","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FMf\u002F7t\u002FSDSDRPPVIE6A.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FH1\u002FY2\u002FDGTNO727X1DQ.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FaG\u002FFe\u002FDGTNO727X1DQ-180x180.JPEG"},"html":"Gridsome is a Vue.js framework that helps to make serverless websites &amp; apps easier, and is open source and free under the MIT license. To support easy, local development, Gridsome enables users to build websites with tools like Vue.js,  GraphQL &amp; all the Node.js &amp; JavaScript ecosystem. Users can develop locally and get instant hot-reloading for any code change.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EGridsome builds performance into every page by using the PRPL pattern. Users get code splitting, asset optimization, progressive images, and link prefetching out of the box. Gridsome sites boast strong page speed scores by default.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EGridsome generates static PWAs. Only critical HTML, CSS, and JavaScript get loaded first. The next pages are then prefetched so users can click around, fast, without page reloads, even when offline.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EGridsome sites load as static HTML before they hydrate into fully Vue.js-powered SPAs. This makes it possible for search engines to be able to crawl content and give better SEO ranking, and still have all the power of Vue.js.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EBecause the modern web is decoupled and modular, Gridsome aims to make it easy to build Jamstack websites using data from multiple sources such as Content API's, Headless CMSs, and other web services.","editionPricing":[],"trialAvailable":false,"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":0},"reviewsRating":{"count":0},"featureRatings":[],"count":0,"avg":0},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"649aded0d4e17802ca7eadf2"}]},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"55954616a5a12b18006788fe","slug":"perforce-zend","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf0200000053","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002F7P\u002FHc\u002FSLNKV72SFUPB.jpeg","square50":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FFc\u002FSI\u002FSN4L8ICJ71A7.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FKw\u002Fla\u002FN7T1C6MUTRZJ.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fd4\u002FS7\u002FN7T1C6MUTRZJ-180x180.JPEG"}},"logo":"https:\u002F\u002Fdudodiprj2sv7.cloudfront.net\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FYQ\u002FI6\u002FKW97HSDNV6JG.png","pricingUrl":"","name":"Zend","description":"Zend, acquired by Rogue Wave Software in 2017 and then by Perforce in 2019, is a PHP Application Server that aims to improve web app deployment, debugging, and monitoring. Zend offers secured PHP Runtimes and Support for Mission-Critical Applications.","trialAvailable":false,"editionPricing":[{"_id":"5fee5a9b6ca4fe0030c6e853"},{"_id":"5fee5add5ec5660042968109"},{"_id":"5fee5aeb93d17d00375b54d6"}],"logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002FJg\u002FB7\u002FQTPZ1K2CCBBF.png","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fj4\u002Fdo\u002FT0R4R7GIWPTU.JPEG","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fproduct-logos\u002Fwy\u002Fes\u002FT0R4R7GIWPTU-180x180.JPEG"},"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":14},"reviewsRating":{"count":0},"featureRatings":[],"count":14,"avg":7.1},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"awards":[],"previousSlugs":["zend-php-engine","zend-server","zend-studio-php-ide"],"startingPrice":{"price":null},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"productDemos":{"files":[{"_id":"649add7cd4e17864bd7c53e7"},{"_id":"649add7cd4e1780f637c53eb"},{"_id":"649add7cd4e17842887c53f0"},{"_id":"649add7cd4e1786e6e7c53f6"},{"_id":"649add7cd4e17859277c53fd"}]},"security":{"whisticLink":""},"html":"Zend, acquired by Rogue Wave Software in 2017 and then by Perforce in 2019, is a PHP Application Server that aims to improve web app deployment, debugging, and monitoring. Zend offers secured PHP Runtimes and Support for Mission-Critical Applications.","meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"65b9473ffb35864efe87aa2b","name":"IBM Cloud Pak for Applications","slug":"ibm-cloud-pak-for-applications","description":"IBM Cloud Pak®  for Applications (CP4Apps) is an end-to-end hybrid cloud application platform, providing flexibility for deployments, building new cloud-native applications, refactoring and re-platforming existing applications. Designed to leverage a collection of application runtimes, modernization tools and a Kubernetes container platform to adapt to their landscape needs.","html":"\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EIBM Cloud Pak for Applications (CP4Apps) provides flexibility for users' application landscape. Whether it's deployments, building new cloud-native applications, refactoring or re-platforming existing applications; CP4Apps is designed-to leverage a comprehensive collection of application runtimes, modernization tools and a Kubernetes container platform enabling the application landscape to transform with the needs of the business.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApplication runtimes and frameworks included: IBM WebSphere®, IBM WebSphere Liberty, Red Hat® JBoss® Enterprise Application Platform, Quarkus, Tomcat, Node.js Spring Boot, Vert.x, etc.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EModernization tools included: IBM Transformation Advisor, IBM Mono2Micro, IBM WebSphere Migration Tool Kit and Red Hat Migration Tool Kit for Applications.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContainer platform included: Red Hat OpenShift®, the hybrid cloud application platform powered by Kubernetes. \u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EBenefits of using CP4Apps as described by IBM include reduced time for migrations and less risk from refactoring during migrations, the optimized delivery of cloud-native apps, and a faster development cycle for new apps and features.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fibm.biz\u002FCP4Apps_Product_page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Ehttps:\u002F\u002Fibm.biz\u002FCP4Apps_Product_page\u003C\u002Fa\u003E \u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","vendor":{"_id":"5061d92eec3bbf02000000cd","logos":{"default":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002FT691TK96I5L1.png","squareOriginal":"","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002Fstd-logos\u002FT691TK96I5L1.png"}},"prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"startingPrice":{"price":null},"trialAvailable":false,"pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ibm.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fcloud-pak-for-applications\u002Fpricing?utm_medium=Peerreview&utm_source=TrustRadius&utm_content=CPAWW&utm_term=30AXL&utm_id=CP4Apps-pricing-page-on-TR","editionPricing":[],"productDemos":{"files":[]},"links":{"backlinkCta":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ibm.com\u002Fproducts\u002Fcloud-pak-for-applications?utm_medium=Peerreview&utm_source=TrustRadius&utm_content=CPAWW&utm_term=30AXL&utm_id=CP4Apps-product-page-on-TR","text":""},"pricing":{"url":"","text":""}},"logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"awards":[],"isSubscribed":false,"security":{"whisticLink":""},"previousSlugs":["cloud-pak-for-applications"],"rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":7},"reviewsRating":{"count":3},"featureRatings":[],"count":10,"avg":7.4},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}},{"doc":{"_id":"60c111231381fd00226c48c7","links":{"backlinkCta":{"text":"","url":""},"pricing":{"text":"","url":""}},"name":"Huawei Cloud ServiceStage","vendor":{"_id":"55ab06dad2da2a1800c45cfc","logos":{"default":"","square180":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002FAG\u002Fvw\u002F4MOX29P1S10T-180x180.JPEG","squareOriginal":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.trustradius.com\u002Fvendor-logos\u002F18\u002FxR\u002F4MOX29P1S10T.JPEG"}},"description":"Huawei Cloud ServiceStage is an application management and O&M platform that lets users develop, build, roll out, monitor, and maintain applications all in one place. So users can do less recoding with the Java, Go, PHP, Node.js, Docker, and Tomcat running environments, and the web, Apache ServiceComb, Spring Cloud, Dubbo, and Service Mesh applications.","pricingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.huaweicloud.com\u002Fintl\u002Fen-us\u002Fpricing\u002Findex.html?tab=detail#\u002Fservicestage","logos":{"default":"","squareOriginal":"","square180":""},"html":"Huawei Cloud ServiceStage is an application management and O&amp;M platform that lets users develop, build, roll out, monitor, and maintain applications all in one place. So users can do less recoding with the Java, Go, PHP, Node.js, Docker, and Tomcat running environments, and the web, Apache ServiceComb, Spring Cloud, Dubbo, and Service Mesh applications.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EThe solution deploys applications using containers, VMs, or serverless, and easily implements auto scaling, performance analysis, and fault diagnosis. It supports native Spring Cloud and Dubbo frameworks and Service Mesh, provides all-scenario capabilities, and supports mainstream languages such as Java, Go, PHP, Node.js, and Python.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EAs a Microservice Application Solution, it provides ServiceComb, Spring Cloud, Dubbo, and Service Mesh, helping customers build enterprise-grade microservice platforms. As a Web Application Solution it presents a one-stop O&amp;M platform greatly improves the efficiency of enterprise-grade web application development and O&amp;M.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","editionPricing":[],"trialAvailable":false,"awards":[],"slug":"huawei-cloud-servicestage","rating":{"simpleRating":{"count":0},"reviewsRating":{"count":0},"featureRatings":[],"count":0,"avg":0},"startingPrice":{"price":0.03},"isSubscribed":false,"prosAndCons":{"pros":[],"cons":[]},"meta":{"review":{"title":"","description":""},"competitors":{"title":"","description":""}}}}],"total":69,"from":0,"size":25},"searchDataLoaded":true,"searchDataError":false,"searchOverrides":null,"searchDefaults":{"sort":null}}}
